"EW-7711AUC V1.0A", "P/C = D01-123" and "1246-"<....>"-50Z" :is silkscreened on the board in the FCC photos. {{see also|ASUS RT-AC52U|ASUS USB-AC51|Edimax}}
A MAC starting with [http://hwaddress.com/?q=AC:22:0B AC:22:0B] (''ASUSTek'') is etched onto :the FCC EUT's USB connector. It's presumed to be used.
*[http://www.skyworksinc.com/Product/1612/SKY85702-11 ''Skyworks SKY85702-11'' 5GHz WLAN Front-End Module]
